      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_16",
      "hash64": "2C90ADE7475275D7",
      "text": "À l’époque, les gens se passionnaient pour\\ntout ce qui avait trait à la Zone Zéro.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_17a",
      "hash64": "0C4A11FE311B913F",
      "text": "Le Livre Écarlate a donc rencontré un immense\\nsuccès. Quasiment tout le monde en possédait\\r\\nun exemplaire.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_17b",
      "hash64": "0C4A12FE311B92F2",
      "text": "Le Livre Violet a donc rencontré un immense\\nsuccès. Quasiment tout le monde en possédait\\r\\nun exemplaire.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_18",
      "hash64": "2C90A3E7475264D9",
      "text": "Mais à cause des descriptions invraisemblables\\net des illustrations fantaisistes qu’il contient,\\r\\nle public a commencé à douter de la véracité\\r\\nde son contenu, et à traiter Bruyer de menteur.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 195,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_19",
      "hash64": "2C90A2E747526326",
      "text": "Le fait même que l’expédition soit bien parvenue\\njusqu’au fond du cratère a été remis en question.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_c_06_history_20a",
      "hash64": "155C66FE365C3861",
      "text": "Et c’est ainsi que le Livre Écarlate s’est retrouvé\\nconsidéré comme un ouvrage sur le paranormal,\\r\\net qu’il a fini par prendre la poussière chez\\r\\nles bouquinistes.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 167,
          "count": 2,
